cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "GF5B-data-processing: a configuration-driven L1 preprocessing base for GF-5B AHSI hyperspectral data"
abstract: >-
  Engineering base for radiometric calibration, RPC + DEM orthorectification,
  interchangeable atmospheric/normalisation backends, band screening, unified
  quality gating and optional SCS+C terrain illumination correction of GF-5B
  AHSI L1 products.
authors:
  - name: "GF5B-data-processing contributors"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-11
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/hakimdkfhdhdjdj356-cpu/GF5B-data-processing"
keywords:
  - hyperspectral
  - remote sensing
  - AHSI
  - GF-5B
  - radiometric calibration
  - atmospheric correction
